-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4753" data-end="5074"><li data-start="4753" data-end="4827"><p data-start="4755" data-end="4827"><strong data-start="4755" data-end="4771">Versatilità:</strong> Ideale per varie applicazioni oltre al purè di patate.</p></li><li data-start="4828" data-end="4942"><p data-start="4830" data-end="4942"><strong data-start="4830" data-end="4859">Funzionalità degli ingredienti:</strong> Può migliorare il legame dell&#039;acqua, struttura, e possono essere inclusi in miscele alimentari composite.</p></li><li data-start="4943" data-end="5074"><p data-start="4945" data-end="5074"><strong data-start="4945" data-end="4965">Efficienza dei costi:</strong> Spesso costo inferiore rispetto ai granuli grazie all&#039;economia del processo di essiccazione. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION Produttore di fiocchi di patate</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><h3 data-start="5076" data-end="5103"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="52_Potato_Granules"></span><strong data-start="5080" data-end="5103">5.2 Granuli di patate</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="5104" data-end="5386"><li data-start="5104" data-end="5187"><p data-start="5106" data-end="5187"><strong data-start="5106" data-end="5125">Consistenza cremosa:</strong> I granuli si reidratano fino a ottenere una poltiglia più liscia e omogenea.</p></li><li data-start="5188" data-end="5257"><p data-start="5190" data-end="5257"><strong data-start="5190" data-end="5209">Densità più elevata:</strong> Migliore efficienza di stoccaggio e trasporto.</p></li><li data-start="5258" data-end="5386"><p data-start="5260" data-end="5386"><strong data-start="5260" data-end="5288">Capacità di utilizzo finito:</strong> Adatto alla reidratazione diretta come prodotto finito in poltiglia. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.idahopacific.com/potato-granules?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Idaho Pacifico</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><hr data-start="5388" data-end="5391" /><h2 data-start="5393" data-end="5441"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Selection_Guidelines_for_Manufacturers"></span><strong data-start="5396" data-end="5441">6. Linee guida per la selezione dei produttori</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5443" data-end="5515">Quando si sceglie tra scaglie e granuli per la produzione alimentare, considerare:</p><div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" data-start="5517" data-end="5904"><thead data-start="5517" data-end="5547"><tr data-start="5517" data-end=